    "$t": "是按怎án-ne生 - 汽水變好lim--ah"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《汽水變好lim--ah》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">洪明道</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgPZyPye0mIekWYQ8DCRiFv5vzJJep8d87-Swc86I3ilrI3mZDK4pXEGZnxUOIm-aCM5Rqiuu1-9dpdxLkgHViFz3-1NK7LWU1PJ8t-UzGaCJqGmsHZlYxsEolv8DrrQn-8HH3x86hE4jHTvaLzeBn4J--dIj4N5_v47Lkl6ImyScwSbaakgJ-B_FG5j49i\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgPZyPye0mIekWYQ8DCRiFv5vzJJep8d87-Swc86I3ilrI3mZDK4pXEGZnxUOIm-aCM5Rqiuu1-9dpdxLkgHViFz3-1NK7LWU1PJ8t-UzGaCJqGmsHZlYxsEolv8DrrQn-8HH3x86hE4jHTvaLzeBn4J--dIj4N5_v47Lkl6ImyScwSbaakgJ-B_FG5j49i=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh1ZJZD0zdS4Z0nUCjQVNRjT9W_eeo7O3aUGJ9HtzVnSTDtSgt8xdzQZgYc5mUVaf3gjsjnN2Lq3aBSAhfMoYwaQb1xhVdw_C9CvMi4JkEL4jol2ChRbU2Z6qfYJCx_ZVdpyzkitZcjmgqfEXed-uXHBgl98SrCzy2veGXiyb5GKrgpi963yt9ShgHQ-MXl\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh1ZJZD0zdS4Z0nUCjQVNRjT9W_eeo7O3aUGJ9HtzVnSTDtSgt8xdzQZgYc5mUVaf3gjsjnN2Lq3aBSAhfMoYwaQb1xhVdw_C9CvMi4JkEL4jol2ChRbU2Z6qfYJCx_ZVdpyzkitZcjmgqfEXed-uXHBgl98SrCzy2veGXiyb5GKrgpi963yt9ShgHQ-MXl=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEitp7Da3Zpht9HPn-7ihhnuNiH6U5BpowI3VoeLRuoQ7boboHzIoao-nsJZftuaHdsgSVHu9coZKV17AEFdt5SEN1brV1JyVdDHBCYIzHRHouFn8ThgYVsLM_sO_1tMfnZn5y-NUJeZ3GiUzKUITouVo7Y3s5XlJv4_ONcmmVWOCZcklhV8mz-gcY2iDh22\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEitp7Da3Zpht9HPn-7ihhnuNiH6U5BpowI3VoeLRuoQ7boboHzIoao-nsJZftuaHdsgSVHu9coZKV17AEFdt5SEN1brV1JyVdDHBCYIzHRHouFn8ThgYVsLM_sO_1tMfnZn5y-NUJeZ3GiUzKUITouVo7Y3s5XlJv4_ONcmmVWOCZcklhV8mz-gcY2iDh22=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">前兩日仔天氣反寒。芯--a嚨喉ngiau-ngiau，講話小可sau聲。伊想講凡勢水lim siunn少，茶鈷lóng té-tīnn-tīnn紮去學校。Koh來，伊頭殼開始疼，鼻水kòng-kòng流，規个人siān-tauh-tauh。冊看bē lueh， mā無啥khuì力sńg。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Kánn-ná感--著--neh。」阿爸看伊規工嗽無歇，khe̍h一盒喙am hōo伊掛。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿母問--伊，「Kám ài kā老師請幾日仔假，thìng好踮厝--裡歇睏？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">芯--a想講，tī厝--裡規工閒閒無代誌做，iáu是先擋看māi--leh，去學校上無ē-tàng看同學sńg。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">散學tńg來到厝，阿母提感應額頭ê度針，kā芯--a磅溫度，37.8，tsit聲發燒--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿媽kā芯--a ia̍t手，叫伊去灶跤一tsuā。入去灶跤，芯--a看阿媽uì冰箱kuānn一罐汽水出--來，倒入去玻璃杯仔。Suà--落-來，阿媽腰ànn落去提鹽，攑細枝匙仔掖一tshok鹽花仔。鹽浸入去汽水內面，沓沓仔溶--去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">鹽摻入去汽水，tshìng tsiânn濟pho出--來，頂面一沿phue̍h。芯--a手phak踮桌頂，看鹽án-ne一粒一粒，聊聊仔變無--去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「芯--a，tsit杯kā lim--lueh，看嚨喉ē khah好--bē。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">芯--a聽人leh講，感冒m̄-thang lim冰--ê。M̄-koh，伊mā bat聽人講，感冒食冰嚨喉ē khah爽快。M̄知siáng講--ê tsiah tio̍h。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">伊杯仔phâng--leh，tam--一-喙，kánn-ná bē歹lim--liooh。伊頭攑kuân，規杯kā灌--落-去。氣pho過嚨喉ê時，淡薄仔tsha̍k-tsha̍k，koh冰冰涼涼。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Lín阿公khah早感冒，上愛lim tsit味--ê。」阿媽講。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">汽水kánn-ná變好lim--ah。芯--a想講，無感冒ê時，mā想beh透來lim看māi--leh。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">M̄-koh，he鹽走佗位去？是按怎加鹽了，pho ē濟濟tshìng--出-來？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">芯--a按怎to想無，頭殼mā bē輸leh tshìng煙。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">※　&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※　&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiRU49JlEW03-h5wf3tkXuLnvdJpSpYd1NV9eQ65Zb0T7C3-EVvpgUamg-_LiYBQmbtvrPmcaUD61FrP0ofsht3rvT3AhLup-5qAbwnv9FjLm9yV9QlcY2tU3dezqM9vFl5A_A2tVZrQD-yuwd5u1lfFYN5qjO_TCFTZm2qs8fgKAzOjXS8PFBwtkBSLQ5y\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"397\" data-original-width=\"594\" height=\"429\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiRU49JlEW03-h5wf3tkXuLnvdJpSpYd1NV9eQ65Zb0T7C3-EVvpgUamg-_LiYBQmbtvrPmcaUD61FrP0ofsht3rvT3AhLup-5qAbwnv9FjLm9yV9QlcY2tU3dezqM9vFl5A_A2tVZrQD-yuwd5u1lfFYN5qjO_TCFTZm2qs8fgKAzOjXS8PFBwtkBSLQ5y=w640-h429\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán若是掖鹽，鹽kah水lām做伙，規个溶--去看bē著。Tsit款現象，號做溶解（iûnn-kái）。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">兩項mi̍h件lām做伙，若是ē-tàng lām kah tsiok tsiâu勻，lán就kā khah少ê hit項號做「溶質」（iông-tsit，solute），khah濟ê hit項號做「溶劑」（iông-tse，solvent）。兩項mi̍h件kap做伙，號做「溶液」（iông-i̍k，solution）。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">用頭前ê例來講，鹽是溶質，水是溶劑，鹽水就是溶液。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Mi̍h件m̄是逐項lām落去水內底，lóng ē溶--去。像講胡椒粒仔，lán若kā掖水--裡，iáu是看ē著一粒一粒。胡椒粒仔ē散--開，m̄-koh bē散kah真tsiâu勻。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán若beh kā胡椒粒仔kah水分開，ē-tàng攑ngeh仔，一粒一粒kā ngeh--起-來。若無，mā ē-sái提篩仔，kā胡椒粒仔hôo--起-來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">M̄-koh，若beh kā鹽uì鹽水分離--出-來，就無tsiah-nī簡單--ah。Khah早台灣西南部ê人，用「曝鹽」tsit步，kā鹽uì海水分離--出-來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">海水是鹹水，內底ê溶質鹽上濟。海水代先hông引入去水坵，he是khah淺ê池仔。日--時日頭赤iānn-iānn，熱度kā水份si̍h--去。暗時霜風直直搧，ta燥ê空氣kā水khau-ta。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一日曝過一日，坵盤頂面沓沓仔堅鹽。鹽工tsiah用鹽收仔，kā粗鹽put做伙。落尾，in tsiah kā鹽擔去piànn做一堆，積--起-來兩三樓kuân，tse就是lán看--著ê鹽山。Tsit款曝鹽ê所在，號做鹽埕。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Beh kā溶質分離ài經過一寡程序。提曝鹽tsit个例來講，ài經過加熱、結晶。Kā胡椒粒仔分離就m̄免tsiah費氣。Tse就是差tī有溶解、無溶解。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK